{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SAVE THE HUMAN RACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reclaim the fallen earth and battle against the extinction of your species.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE AN OPEN-WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into a post-apocalyptic earth with unearthly threats where danger lurks in every corner. Discover new locations, uncover the secrets of the past.\u00a0Roam freely across vast, diverse landscapes. Explore abandoned points of interest where you will encounter unknown dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER A COMPELLING STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the enigmatic story behind Earth's downfall. Piece together the clues to understand the events that led to catastrophic changes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGHT TO SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival is everything. Face off against terrifying, harsh environments, hostile enemies that prowl the desolate world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhanced movement capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intuitive looting and crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive gun play and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plethora of skills to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse photogenic environments</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517090?t=1741437715","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517090?t=1741437715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517090/6b84ef1baff698c41a4e3ed52a819f30500ee03b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741437715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517090/6b84ef1baff698c41a4e3ed52a819f30500ee03b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741437715","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":nu